{"seq":2,"slug":"collateral-instrument-ledger","title":"担保品台账与状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-tax-guarantee-bond-insurance/guarantee-quota-ledger/collateral-instrument-ledger","wordCount":1947,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"担保品台账与状态\">担保品台账与状态</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>额度池记录的是&quot;还剩多少可用的担保能力&quot;，但它不记录&quot;这份能力来自什么&quot;。这一层由担保品台账承担：银行保函、关税保证保险保单、保证金账户，各自是需要独立建档、独立跟踪有效期与状态的实体。两者的关系是一对多——一份担保品可以支撑一个或多个额度池，额度的变化由担保品状态驱动，担保品一旦失效，其支撑的额度也必须同步失效。</p>\n<p>把这两层分开建模的理由很实际：担保品的生命周期由外部机构（银行、保险公司、海关）主导，变更有法定形式要求；额度池的生命周期由业务系统主导，变更频繁且由申报事件驱动。混在一张表里会让&quot;银行要求变更保函金额&quot;这类事件触发全表重算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"担保品的分类与公共字段\">担保品的分类与公共字段</h2><p>三类担保品共享一组公共字段，另有各自的特有字段。公共字段的设计原则是<strong>只放与状态判定、有效期判定相关的信息</strong>，业务细节留在各自的扩展表。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE guarantee_instrument (&#10;  instrument_id   TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  instrument_type TEXT NOT NULL,        -- BANK_GUARANTEE / DUTY_INSURANCE / CASH_DEPOSIT&#10;  enterprise_id   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  issuer_id       TEXT NOT NULL,        -- 出具机构（银行/保险公司/海关账户）&#10;  face_amount     NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL,  -- 担保金额&#10;  currency        CHAR(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;CNY&#39;,&#10;  beneficiary     TEXT NOT NULL,        -- 受益人（海关，可多个直属海关）&#10;  issued_at       DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_from      DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_to        DATE NOT NULL,        -- 担保期限终点&#10;  status          TEXT NOT NULL,        -- DRAFT/ACTIVE/AMENDED/SUSPENDED/EXPIRED/CANCELLED/CLAIMED&#10;  doc_ref         TEXT                  -- 保函号 / 保单号 / 保证金凭证号&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 一份担保品可支撑多个额度池；额度的可用性受担保品状态约束&#10;CREATE TABLE instrument_quota_link (&#10;  instrument_id   TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES guarantee_instrument(instrument_id),&#10;  filing_no       TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES quota_pool(filing_no),&#10;  allocated_amount NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL,  -- 从担保品划给该池的额度&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (instrument_id, filing_no)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> guarantee_instrument</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instrument_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instrument_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- BANK_GUARANTEE / DUTY_INSURANCE / CASH_DEPOSIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  enterprise_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  issuer_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 出具机构（银行/保险公司/海关账户）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  face_amount     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 担保金额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CNY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  beneficiary     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 受益人（海关，可多个直属海关）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  issued_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_from      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_to        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 担保期限终点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- DRAFT/ACTIVE/AMENDED/SUSPENDED/EXPIRED/CANCELLED/CLAIMED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  doc_ref         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  -- 保函号 / 保单号 / 保证金凭证号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 一份担保品可支撑多个额度池；额度的可用性受担保品状态约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> instrument_quota_link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instrument_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> guarantee_instrument(instrument_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  filing_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_pool(filing_no),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  allocated_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 从担保品划给该池的额度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (instrument_id, filing_no)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"三类担保品的特有字段\">三类担保品的特有字段</h3><p>保证金多一个账户维度——它对应一个真实的资金账户，余额会因抵缴而变化；银行保函多一个反担保维度——企业往往向银行提供了质押或保证，这部分需在同一台账里登记以便计算真实的资金占用；关税保证保险多一个保险期间与赔付条款维度——保单的保险期间可能与担保期限不完全重合。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>保证金</th>\n<th>银行保函</th>\n<th>关税保证保险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>独有标识</td>\n<td>保证金账户号</td>\n<td>保函号</td>\n<td>保单号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额可变性</td>\n<td>抵缴后余额减少</td>\n<td>变更需换发保函</td>\n<td>加保需批单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反担保登记</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>质押/保证/信用</td>\n<td>通常无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期限约束</td>\n<td>无固定期限</td>\n<td>担保期限载明</td>\n<td>保险期间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出具机构类型</td>\n<td>海关指定账户</td>\n<td>银行/非银行金融机构</td>\n<td>保险公司</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失效主因</td>\n<td>抵缴耗尽</td>\n<td>到期或注销</td>\n<td>到期、退保或理赔终了</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"状态机与迁移条件\">状态机与迁移条件</h2><p>担保品的状态不是装饰性的标签，每一条迁移都对应一个外部事件与一个额度后果。设计状态机时最重要的问题是：<strong>每条迁移对额度有什么影响</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; DRAFT: 申请开立/投保&#10;  DRAFT --&gt; ACTIVE: 出具机构出单 + 海关接受备案&#10;  ACTIVE --&gt; AMENDED: 变更/加保/延期(换发或批单)&#10;  AMENDED --&gt; ACTIVE: 变更生效&#10;  ACTIVE --&gt; SUSPENDED: 暂停使用(如企业信用等级下调)&#10;  SUSPENDED --&gt; ACTIVE: 风险解除&#10;  ACTIVE --&gt; EXPIRED: 到达 valid_to 未续期&#10;  ACTIVE --&gt; CANCELLED: 注销/退保, 且已无未结占用&#10;  ACTIVE --&gt; CLAIMED: 海关索赔/抵缴&#10;  CLAIMED --&gt; CANCELLED: 赔付完毕并结清&#10;  EXPIRED --&gt; [*]&#10;  CANCELLED --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; DRAFT: 申请开立/投保\n  DRAFT --&gt; ACTIVE: 出具机构出单 + 海关接受备案\n  ACTIVE --&gt; AMENDED: 变更/加保/延期(换发或批单)\n  AMENDED --&gt; ACTIVE: 变更生效\n  ACTIVE --&gt; SUSPENDED: 暂停使用(如企业信用等级下调)\n  SUSPENDED --&gt; ACTIVE: 风险解除\n  ACTIVE --&gt; EXPIRED: 到达 valid_to 未续期\n  ACTIVE --&gt; CANCELLED: 注销/退保, 且已无未结占用\n  ACTIVE --&gt; CLAIMED: 海关索赔/抵缴\n  CLAIMED --&gt; CANCELLED: 赔付完毕并结清\n  EXPIRED --&gt; [*]\n  CANCELLED --&gt; [*]</pre><h3 id=\"注销的前置条件是零未结占用\">注销的前置条件是零未结占用</h3><p>这是状态机里最容易实现错的一条。担保品可以在业务结束时注销，但<strong>注销的前提是它支撑的所有额度池都没有未结占用</strong>。若企业直接退保而届时仍有未缴税款挂在该保单担保的额度池上，退保会抽走海关的受偿来源。因此注销请求必须触发一次跨表校验：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 注销前置校验：任一关联额度池仍有未结占用则拒绝注销&#10;SELECT l.filing_no,&#10;       p.total_amount,&#10;       p.used_amount,&#10;       p.frozen_amount,&#10;       SUM(e.amount) FILTER (WHERE e.event_type = &#39;CONFIRM&#39;) AS confirmed_total&#10;  FROM instrument_quota_link l&#10;  JOIN quota_pool p ON p.filing_no = l.filing_no&#10;  LEFT JOIN quota_event e ON e.filing_no = l.filing_no&#10; WHERE l.instrument_id = :instrument_id&#10; GROUP BY l.filing_no, p.total_amount, p.used_amount, p.frozen_amount&#10;HAVING p.used_amount &gt; 0 OR p.frozen_amount &gt; 0;&#10;-- 返回任何行 =&gt; 拒绝 CANCELLED 迁移，返回占用明细供人工处理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 注销前置校验：任一关联额度池仍有未结占用则拒绝注销</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filing_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">used_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CONFIRM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> confirmed_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instrument_quota_link l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_pool p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filing_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filing_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_event e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filing_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filing_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">instrument_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :instrument_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filing_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">used_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">used_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 返回任何行 => 拒绝 CANCELLED 迁移，返回占用明细供人工处理</span></span></code></pre></div><p>拒绝注销时的正确行为不是简单报错，而是返回明细并给出可执行的下一步：告知哪几票未结、分别多少钱、预计何时可释放。这与 <a href=\"../bond-lifecycle-claim/bond-issue-amend-cancel\">保函开立/变更/注销</a> 中讨论的变更流程共用同一套校验逻辑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"到期不是瞬间事件-而是一段预警窗口\">到期不是瞬间事件，而是一段预警窗口</h3><p><code>valid_to</code> 之后担保品失效，但在失效之前需要一段预警窗口，因为延期或续开都要走外部流程，银行和保险公司的审批有周期。可行的设计是把有效期管理拆成三个阈值：T-90 天进入续期提醒，T-30 天进入强制跟进（未启动续期则预警升级），T-7 天进入阻断（若届时仍有未结占用，则挂起该池的新申报）。阈值取值应结合担保机构的实际审批周期——保函换发通常需要一到数周，保单批改相对快，因此保险那一支的阈值可以更靠近到期日。</p>\n<h3 id=\"暂停状态与额度联动\">暂停状态与额度联动</h3><p><code>SUSPENDED</code> 是一个容易被忽略的状态。它表示担保品在形式上仍然有效、金额未变，但因为外部原因（企业信用等级下调、被暂停高级认证企业管理措施等）暂时不可用于新的申报。它的额度后果是：关联额度池的可用额度立即归零，新申报被拒绝，但已确认的占用不受影响——因为已经放行的货物其税款义务并未消失。</p>\n<p>这个区分很重要：<strong>暂停影响的是&quot;新占用&quot;，不是&quot;已占用&quot;</strong>。把暂停实现成&quot;清空额度&quot;，会导致已放行货物的担保凭空消失，这正是错误释放的典型形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"担保品的登记与核验\">担保品的登记与核验</h2><p>担保品不能只凭企业录入就生效。台账里每一条 ACTIVE 记录背后都应有外部机构的确认凭据：保函的真伪验核、保单的承保确认、保证金账户的入账回执。汇总征税制度明确要求担保机构&quot;配合保函真伪验核&quot;，这一条在系统里的落点就是<strong>登记环节必须留下核验证据</strong>（<a href=\"http://policy.mofcom.gov.cn/claw/clawContent.shtml?id=62961\">海关总署公告2017年第45号</a>）。台账的字段设计也有法定依据：条例第十三条规定保函必须载明担保人、被担保人、被担保的法律义务、担保金额、担保期限与担保责任六项要素，并加盖印章、注明日期（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/flfg/2010-09/19/content_1709252.htm\">国务院令第581号</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;instrument_registration&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;instrument_id&quot;: &quot;INS-2026-000178&quot;,&#10;    &quot;instrument_type&quot;: &quot;BANK_GUARANTEE&quot;,&#10;    &quot;doc_ref&quot;: &quot;BG2026SH0012345&quot;,&#10;    &quot;issuer&quot;: { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;某商业银行上海分行&quot;, &quot;institution_code&quot;: &quot;BANK_XXXX&quot; },&#10;    &quot;face_amount&quot;: 10000000.0,&#10;    &quot;beneficiary&quot;: [&quot;上海海关&quot;, &quot;南京海关&quot;, &quot;杭州海关&quot;],&#10;    &quot;valid_from&quot;: &quot;2026-01-01&quot;,&#10;    &quot;valid_to&quot;: &quot;2026-12-31&quot;,&#10;    &quot;verification&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;method&quot;: &quot;ISSUER_ELECTRONIC_CONFIRM&quot;,&#10;      &quot;verified_at&quot;: &quot;2026-01-04T10:22:00+08:00&quot;,&#10;      &quot;evidence_ref&quot;: &quot;EBANK-BG-CONFIRM-20260104-0007&quot;,&#10;      &quot;customs_filing_no&quot;: &quot;ZB2026SH0000123&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;status&quot;: &quot;ACTIVE&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"instrument_registration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"instrument_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INS-2026-000178\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"instrument_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BANK_GUARANTEE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"doc_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BG2026SH0012345\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"issuer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"某商业银行上海分行\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"institution_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BANK_XXXX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"face_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"beneficiary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"上海海关\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"南京海关\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"杭州海关\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"valid_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-01-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"valid_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-12-31\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"verification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ISSUER_ELECTRONIC_CONFIRM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"verified_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-01-04T10:22:00+08:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"evidence_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EBANK-BG-CONFIRM-20260104-0007\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"customs_filing_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ZB2026SH0000123\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ACTIVE\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>beneficiary</code> 是多值的，因为汇总征税的总担保保函受益人&quot;应包括企业注册地直属海关以及其他进出口地直属海关&quot;。若系统把它建模成单值字符串，在跨关区申报时会出现&quot;保函不被受理&quot;的问题，而排查方向会被误导到保函本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"台账的一致性维护\">台账的一致性维护</h2><p>担保品台账与额度池之间的分配关系（<code>instrument_quota_link</code>）需要满足一条不变量：<strong>同一担保品的所有分配额之和不得超过其面额</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mtext>filing</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mtext>links</mtext></mrow></munder><mtext>allocated_amount</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mtext>face_amount</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{\\text{filing} \\in \\text{links}} \\text{allocated\\_amount} \\le \\text{face\\_amount}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">filing</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">links</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">allocated_amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">face_amount</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条不变量的维护方式与额度扣减相同——条件更新。它的现实意义是防止&quot;一份 1000 万保函被分配给三个各需 500 万的额度池&quot;，这种配置在单池视角下完全正常，只有跨池聚合才会暴露。相关的差异检测与对账逻辑见 <a href=\"../guarantee-ops-optimize/guarantee-reconcile-audit\">担保台账对账与审计</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>担保品台账与额度池是两层结构、一对多关系；前者由外部机构主导变更，后者由申报事件驱动，必须分开建模。</li>\n<li>三类担保品共享公共字段（金额、受益人、有效期、状态），各自的特有字段放在扩展层。</li>\n<li>注销的前置条件是关联额度池零未结占用，拒绝时应返回明细与可执行下一步，而不是简单报错。</li>\n<li>到期是带预警窗口的过程而非瞬间事件；续期提醒、强制跟进、阻断三档阈值应结合担保机构的审批周期设定。</li>\n<li>暂停状态只影响新占用，不影响已占用——把暂停实现成&quot;清空额度&quot;会造成错误释放。</li>\n<li>登记环节必须留下外部核验证据；受益人是多值字段，否则跨关区申报会被拒而不明原因。</li>\n<li>跨池不变量是&quot;分配额之和不超过面额&quot;，维护方式与额度扣减同为条件更新。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步：额度可用性如何联动放行，见 <a href=\"quota-clearance-facilitation\">额度与清关便利联动</a>；变更与注销的业务流程见 <a href=\"../bond-lifecycle-claim/bond-issue-amend-cancel\">保函开立/变更/注销</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"担保品台账与状态","id":"担保品台账与状态"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"担保品的分类与公共字段","id":"担保品的分类与公共字段"},{"level":3,"text":"三类担保品的特有字段","id":"三类担保品的特有字段"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机与迁移条件","id":"状态机与迁移条件"},{"level":3,"text":"注销的前置条件是零未结占用","id":"注销的前置条件是零未结占用"},{"level":3,"text":"到期不是瞬间事件，而是一段预警窗口","id":"到期不是瞬间事件-而是一段预警窗口"},{"level":3,"text":"暂停状态与额度联动","id":"暂停状态与额度联动"},{"level":2,"text":"担保品的登记与核验","id":"担保品的登记与核验"},{"level":2,"text":"台账的一致性维护","id":"台账的一致性维护"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"担保额度的占用与释放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-tax-guarantee-bond-insurance/guarantee-quota-ledger/guarantee-quota-occupy-release"},"next":{"title":"额度与清关便利联动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-tax-guarantee-bond-insurance/guarantee-quota-ledger/quota-clearance-facilitation"}}